		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Veridian scales, thick as plate mail, alternate with bony dermal plating all over this dragon's serpentine body.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d6) or 1 bile breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bile Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 5d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Bileblood</strong>. Poison immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Miasma</strong>. Using its bile breath, create a poison fog centered on dragon, as per cloudkill.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
